15
00:00:33.061 --> 00:00:42.107
Files in the directories above where you launched load at startup; files in subdirectories load on demand, when Claude reads or edits something there.

16
00:00:42.387 --> 00:00:45.757
Instructions closer to your working directory are read last.

17
00:00:46.037 --> 00:00:47.851
A few mechanics are worth knowing.

18
00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:55.533
@path imports pull another file in, but the docs note imports organize content without reducing its context cost.

19
00:00:55.813 --> 00:01:02.555
Block-level HTML comments are stripped before loading, so you can leave notes for human maintainers for free.

20
00:01:02.835 --> 00:01:10.685
claude/rules/ holds topic files, and a rule with paths: frontmatter loads only when Claude works on matching files.

21
00:01:10.965 --> 00:01:13.696
After /compact, the project-root CLAUDE.

22
00:01:13.976 --> 00:01:15.619
md is re-read from disk.

23
00:01:15.899 --> 00:01:20.528
To confirm what loaded, run /context all and look under Memory files.

24
00:01:20.808 --> 00:01:29.085
And /init drafts a starting file from your codebase; the best-practices page says that from there “the work is mostly removing lines.

25
00:01:29.365 --> 00:01:29.663
”.

